```mermaid
flowchart TD
    User["Engineering User / Developer"] -->|HTTP / Web Browser| UI["Streamlit UI (Port 8501)"]
    User -->|REST API Requests| API["FastAPI Application Server (Port 8000)"]
    UI -->|Async HTTP Client / Direct Service| API

    subgraph Core ["Local Knowledge Copilot Modular Monolith"]
        API --> IngestionService["Application: IngestionService"]
        API --> QueryService["Application: QueryService"]
        API --> SessionService["Application: SessionService"]
        
        QueryService --> Agent["Agent: AgentOrchestrator"]
        Agent --> ASTCalc["Tool: AST Calculator (Safe Math)"]
        Agent --> Verifier["Evidence Verifier & Citations Gate"]
        
        QueryService --> RAG["RAG Engine (Hybrid BM25 + Dense)"]
        IngestionService --> RAG
    end

    subgraph Storage ["Persistence & Retrieval Adapters"]
        RAG -->|Vector Search & Hash Chunks| Redis["Redis Stack (Port 6380)"]
        IngestionService -->|Vector Indexing / Deletion| Redis
        SessionService -->|WAL Mode Sessions & Turns| SQLite["SQLite Database (assistant_memory.sqlite)"]
        IngestionService -->|Metadata & Content Chunks| SQLite
    end

    subgraph Inference ["Local Inference Provider"]
        Agent -->|OpenAI-Compatible REST (Port 1234)| LMStudio["LM Studio (Mistral / Qwen GGUF)"]
    end

    subgraph Telemetry ["Observability"]
        API --> Prometheus["Prometheus Metrics (/metrics)"]
        API --> StructLog["JSON Structured Logging & Tracing"]
    end
```
